    "updated_at": "2025-12-20T03:36:26Z",
    "body": "https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/html/semantics/forms/the-select-element/customizable-select/selectedcontent-mutations.html\n\nGiven:\n\n```html\n<div id=test3>\n  <select>\n    <button>\n      <selectedcontent>outer1\n        <selectedcontent>inner1</selectedcontent>\n      </selectedcontent>\n      <selectedcontent>outer2\n        <selectedcontent>inner2</selectedcontent>\n      </selectedcontent>\n    </button>\n    <option>option</option>\n  </select>\n</div>\n```\n\nThe latest selectedcontent-mutations.html expects test3's `innerHTML` to be:\n\n```html\n<select>\n    <button>\n      <selectedcontent>option</selectedcontent>\n      <selectedcontent>outer2\n        <selectedcontent>inner2</selectedcontent>\n      </selectedcontent>\n    </button>\n    <option>option</option>\n  </select>\n```\n\nI think it should be:\n\n```html\n <select>\n    <button>\n      <selectedcontent>option</selectedcontent>\n      <selectedcontent></selectedcontent>\n    </button>\n    <option>option</option>\n  </select>\n```\n\nouter2 is a non-primary selectedcontent, so it should be cleared?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
